{
  "name": "LinkedIn Post Automation with AI & Slack Approval",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "height": 406.2598595936021,
        "width": 436.02806651017256,
        "content": "## 🚀 LinkedIn Post Automation with AI & Slack Approval\n\n**Purpose:** Automates LinkedIn content creation with human oversight\n\n### Flow Overview:\n1. **Trigger:** Google Sheets monitors for new post topics (Status = \"Pending\")\n2. **AI Generation:** GPT-4 creates engaging LinkedIn content\n3. **Slack Approval:** Team reviews/edits via interactive buttons\n4. **Publishing:** Posts to LinkedIn profile + groups\n5. **Tracking:** Updates status to \"Posted\" in spreadsheet\n\n### Key Benefits:\n- ✅ 80% time savings on content creation\n- ✅ Human quality control via Slack\n- ✅ Multi-group posting capability\n- ✅ Full tracking in Google Sheets"
      },
      "id": "workflow-overview-linkedin",
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [-1050, -450],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "height": 382.5486193752571,
        "width": 363.19670035612394,
        "content": "## 📊 Google Sheets Trigger\n\n**What it does:**\n- Checks spreadsheet every minute\n- Looks for rows with Status = \"Pending\"\n- Processes one post at a time\n\n**Required Columns:**\n- ID\n- Linkedin Post Title\n- Status (set to \"Pending\" for new posts)\n- Image URL (optional)\n\n**Groups Sheet:**\n- GroupIds (for multi-group posting)"
      },
      "id": "sheets-trigger-note",
      "name": "Sheets Trigger Info",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [-750, -400],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "height": 381.09054325955777,
        "width": 256.8971634855967,
        "content": "## 🤖 AI Content Generation\n\n**GPT-4 generates:**\n- Compelling hook\n- 3-4 informative paragraphs\n- Engagement questions\n- Relevant emojis\n- 4-6 trending hashtags\n- Proper LinkedIn formatting\n\n**Customizable:** Edit prompt for your brand voice"
      },
      "id": "ai-generation-note",
      "name": "AI Generation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [130, -400],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "height": 361.57749667221623,
        "width": 351.7932582011457,
        "content": "## 👍 Slack Approval System\n\n**Interactive Message with:**\n- ✅ Approve button\n- ✏️ Edit button (allows content changes)\n- Preview of generated post\n\n**Approver Configuration:**\n- Change Slack user ID in node settings\n- Can add multiple reviewers\n\n**Webhook receives responses**"
      },
      "id": "slack-approval-note",
      "name": "Slack Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [730, -380],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "height": 250,
        "width": 400,
        "content": "## 🔗 Webhook Handler\n\n**Receives Slack responses:**\n- Approval confirmations\n- Edited content\n- Button interactions\n\n**⚠️ Important:** Configure this URL in your Slack app's Interactive Components"
      },
      "id": "webhook-handler-note",
      "name": "Webhook Handler",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [-750, -800],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "height": 280,
        "width": 380,
        "content": "## 🖼️ Image Upload Process\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Register image with LinkedIn\n2. Download image from URL\n3. Upload binary to LinkedIn\n\n**Supported formats:** JPEG, PNG\n**Max size:** 10MB"
